Open the resulting markdown and spot-check that the five required sections are present and that the evidence block is preserved verbatim (no invented HTTP responses).
6.4 Stretch goals

    Add a --batch mode that walks a directory of YAML files and produces one aggregate report.md with a table of contents.
    Add a --json output alongside the markdown that carries structured fields (CWE ID, ATT&CK IDs, likelihood, exploitability) for consumption by a defect-tracker importer.
